{"id":"d77f54c9499e3bba","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-basic-axioms.md","title":"Basic Arithmetic Axioms","display":"df-basic-axioms — Basic Arithmetic Axioms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-basic-axioms","aliases":["62-df-basic-axioms"],"display":"df-basic-axioms — Basic Arithmetic Axioms","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.4(i)","source_pages":[4],"source_pdf_pages":[22]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-basic-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-basic-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-basic-axioms — Basic Arithmetic Axioms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.4(i)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>4</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>22</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2=S_2\">\\(L_2=S_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UC}\">\\(\\operatorname{UC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\">\\(m,n\\)</span> 是数变量；这里引入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm Q_2\">\\(\\mathrm Q_2\\)</span> 是有限句子集合，不含归纳或理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}basic\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm Q_2\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\alpha):\\alpha\\in\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n+1\\ne0,\\quad m+1=n+1\\to m=n,\\\\\n&amp;m+0=m,\\quad m+(n+1)=(m+n)+1,\\\\\n&amp;m\\cdot0=0,\\quad m\\cdot(n+1)=m\\cdot n+m,\\\\\n&amp;\\neg m&lt;0,\\quad m&lt;n+1\\leftrightarrow(m&lt;n\\lor m=n)\n\\end{aligned}\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}basic\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm Q_2\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\alpha):\\alpha\\in\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n+1\\ne0,\\quad m+1=n+1\\to m=n,\\\\\n&amp;m+0=m,\\quad m+(n+1)=(m+n)+1,\\\\\n&amp;m\\cdot0=0,\\quad m\\cdot(n+1)=m\\cdot n+m,\\\\\n&amp;\\neg m&lt;0,\\quad m&lt;n+1\\leftrightarrow(m&lt;n\\lor m=n)\n\\end{aligned}\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用书中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,+,\\cdot,&lt;,\\in\">\\(0,1,+,\\cdot,&lt;,\\in\\)</span> 签名和八条基本公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 不是新增函数符号。名称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm Q_2\">\\(\\mathrm Q_2\\)</span> 是本目录沿用的基本公理表标签，不能将它直接认作具有其他公理表的 Robinson Q。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition I.2.4(i)；纸面页 4；PDF 页 22。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_2=S_2$、$\\operatorname{UC}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]。$m,n$ 是数变量；这里引入的 $\\mathrm Q_2$ 是有限句子集合，不含归纳或理解。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_2=S_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UC}","display":false},{"tex":"m,n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm Q_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}basic\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm Q_2\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\alpha):\\alpha\\in\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n&n+1\\ne0,\\quad m+1=n+1\\to m=n,\\\\\n&m+0=m,\\quad m+(n+1)=(m+n)+1,\\\\\n&m\\cdot0=0,\\quad m\\cdot(n+1)=m\\cdot n+m,\\\\\n&\\neg m<0,\\quad m<n+1\\leftrightarrow(m<n\\lor m=n)\n\\end{aligned}\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"0,1,+,\\cdot,<,\\in","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm Q_2","display":false}],"bytes":1242,"backlinks":[{"id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]] 的 $\\mathrm Q_2$、[[62-df-set-induction]] 的 $\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}$、[[62-df-ACA]] 的 $\\mathrm{ACA}(S_2)$。"},{"id":"0f9bb628fd6df6ce","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语法见 [[62-df-L2]]，基本公理 $\\mathrm Q_2$ 见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]，归纳生成算子 $\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Induction]]，$\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]。$\\mathrm{PA}$、$\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1$ 在下式引入；所有公理通过同一签名嵌入 $L_2$。"},{"id":"3531afe9aa28ab10","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基本公理见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]，归纳模式见 [[62-df-Induction]]，完整公式类见 [[62-df-L2]]。"},{"id":"2d44fbf8bf7ebe4d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基本公理、集合归纳与理解模式见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]、[[62-df-set-induction]]、[[62-df-Pi1-CA]]。"},{"id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基本公理 $\\mathrm Q_2$ 见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]；两种模式分别见 [[62-df-Delta1-CA]]、[[62-df-Sigma1-Ind]]。"},{"id":"ce7850ab3516c1cc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基本公理见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]，集合归纳见 [[62-df-set-induction]]，完整公式类和理解模式见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-Comprehension]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-18","lo